  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다. </span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요. </span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div><p>집에서 잠시 찍었습니다.</p><p><iframe id=\"va90dF0PUFhPzJbPhjvfJrf\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/va90dF0PUFhPzJbPhjvfJrf?service=daum_cafe&f=p&ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InZhOTBkRjBQVUZoUHpKYlBoanZmSnJmIiwidGlkIjoiNmMyOWRmYjEtZjM1OS00YWMzLTk3MjktNTRkNjJmYmNhZjczIiwiYXBwX2lkIjoiZGF1bV9jYWZlIiwiZXhwIjoxNzg2MTgxOTIzfQ.YXqJ06vdVpHjgbM2whYMxoRqJTTOdpUyUvV9hHAL_iIQO43GYewwbItaQ2NpZNG2jqyQCvsEIjY6bTrTxeDhZA&autoplay=0\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p><p>진동판 떨리는 영상입니다. 유튜브에서 가지고 왔습니다.</p><p><br></p><p><iframe id=\"vef1deo7e7WessWbaB7DDMh\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/vef1deo7e7WessWbaB7DDMh?service=daum_cafe&f=p&ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InZlZjFkZW83ZTdXZXNzV2JhQjdERE1oIiwidGlkIjoiYjBkNDI3ZGEtMTM4Yy00YmRlLWFjYTUtZTI0MjI2NzM0ZGQxIiwiYXBwX2lkIjoiZGF1bV9jYWZlIiwiZXhwIjoxNzg2MTgxOTIzfQ.ZUdo6yzW9wnL63dMdLf5V-X52SYk91o0iFKLzzUTkovRj1PLTHO4a-OjGg_IHTUtw--vNCK8aBD1iffqSWtQ0g&autoplay=0\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p><p><br></p></div><p><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->